# node_modules is git-tracked in this repo. Without this file, npm install
# on Windows rewrites ~200 files with CRLF line endings, polluting every
# diff with whitespace-only noise. Normalize everything to LF on checkout
# and commit, regardless of the OS doing the checking out.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.db binary
